    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38808" root="مكد" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَدَ</span></b> , (S, L, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكُدَ</span></b> , (L,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكُودٌ</span>
(S, L, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْدٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He remained, stayed,
abode,</i> or <i>dwelt,</i> (S, L, K,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِمَكَانٍ</span> <i>in a place;</i>
(S, L;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَتَ</span>. (TA.)

